                                                "sense_id": "3ff97255-a5b1-34a8-a5e5-b0ad1cc63f4a",
                                                "text": "Our study researches the role that hodonyms play in forming cultural and collective identity and awareness in the city of Chisinau (Kishinev), capital of Moldova, ex-Soviet Republic, during the period 1989 till present. […] The cases are opposite when the change of the hodonym does not lead to a change in semantics."
